<title>FINLAND: Rauma confirms to buy 1 mln own shares.</title>
<headline>Rauma confirms to buy 1 mln own shares.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering group Rauma Oy confirmed on Wednesday it would buy one million of its own shares from forestry group UPM-Kymmene at 113.50 markka each in UPM's plan to cut its stake in the company.</p>
<p>The shares will be cancelled so Rauma's shares in issue will fall to 53 million from reduced from 54 million, Rauma said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +3589 6805 0247, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
